  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Pat haloumi dry with a paper towel and cut haloumi into 1 cm slices. Finely shred baby cos lettuce. Slice cucumber into thin rounds. Roughly chop tomato.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/639a7a4b8cb0a673dc0a0be5/step-1315d082.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Cut or tear bake-at-home ciabatta into bite-sized chunks.\n• Place on a lined oven tray with Nan's special seasoning and a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Toss to coat and bake until golden, 5-7 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/639a7a4b8cb0a673dc0a0be5/step-5fc2cd4f.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While croutons are baking, in a shallow bowl, add the plain flour. In a second shallow bowl, whisk the egg. In a third shallow bowl, place panko breadcrumbs.\n• Dip haloumi slices into flour, followed by egg, and finally panko breadcrumbs. Set aside on a plate.\n• Heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with enough olive oil to coat the base.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 2 minutes each side. Set aside on a plate-towel lined plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/639a7a4b8cb0a673dc0a0be5/step-955d0121.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large bowl, combine caesar dressing and a splash of water. To the bowl, add cucumber, tomato, baby cos lettuce and croutons. Toss to combine and season to taste.\n• Divide caesar-style salad between bowls, top with crumbed haloumi and garnish with shaved Parmesan cheese to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/639a7a4b8cb0a673dc0a0be5/step-87ef9f32.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
